'''Hidesight''' is a spell used to completely hide objects or [[Titans]] from sight. This spell is similar to [[Camoforge]], which is used to turn the caster invisible.

== History ==
Hidesight was used by [[Stack]] to make [[Divine Mirror Kagami]] invisible in order to ambush the Huntik Team on the [[Avalon]] island. The spell was of good help when Zhalia Moon tried using her [[King Basilisk]]'s Stonegaze ability to petrify [[the Organization]], with Divine Mirror Kagami suddenly revealing himself and redirecting the Titan's ability to the Huntik Team, turning [[Dante Vale]] and King Basilisk to stone instead. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}} 

The spell later was used by [[Den Fears]] to hide a [[Stopglue]] trap meant to neutralize the [[Casterwill Hunters]] guarding the entrance of [[Phoenix Volcano]]. Four Casterwill Hunters, unable to see the trap because of the spell, ended up being stuck to it.  {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

